:31.156" end="00:32.411">smell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.115" end="00:35.319"><span begin="00:32.115" end="00:32.683">Of </span><span begin="00:32.683" end="00:33.015">the </span><span begin="00:33.015" end="00:33.343">world </span><span begin="00:33.343" end="00:33.567">that </span><span begin="00:33.567" end="00:33.815">she's </span><span begin="00:33.815" end="00:34.164">left </span><span begin="00:34.164" end="00:35.311">behind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.019" end="00:41.594"><span begin="00:35.019" end="00:36.175">It's </span><span begin="00:36.175" end="00:36.503">all </span><span begin="00:36.503" end="00:36.731">about </span><span begin="00:36.731" end="00:37.355">the </span><span begin="00:37.355" end="00:38.247">exposure </span><span begin="00:38.247" end="00:38.579">the </span><span begin="00:38.579" end="00:39.215">lens </span><span begin="00:39.215" end="00:39.529">I </span><span begin="00:39.529" end="00:39.819">told </span><span begin="00:39.819" end="00:41.589">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.297" end="00:43.662"><span begin="00:41.297" end="00:41.887">The </span><span begin="00:41.887" end="00:42.285">angles </span><span begin="00:42.285" end="00:42.591">were </span><span begin="00:42.591" end="00:42.865">all </span><span begin="00:42.865" end="00:43.128">wrong </span><span begin="00:43.128" end="00:43.654">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.362" end="00:47.823"><span begin="00:43.362" end="00:43.903">She's </span><span begin="00:43.903" end="00:44.155">ripping </span><span begin="00:44.155" end="00:44.451">wings </span><span begin="00:44.451" end="00:44.811">off </span><span begin="00:44.811" end="00:45.163">of </span><span begin="00:45.163" end="00:47.819">butterflies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.523" end="00:53.355"><span begin="00:47.523" end="00:48.075">Keep </span><span begin="00:48.075" end="00:48.635">your </span><span begin="00:48.635" end="00:48.863">feet </span><span begin="00:48.863" end="00:49.107">on </span><span begin="00:49.107" end="00:49.349">the </span><span begin="00:49.349" end="00:53.355">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.055" end="00:55.795"><span begin="00:53.055" end="00:53.589">When </span><span begin="00:53.589" end="00:53.855">your </span><span begin="00:53.855" end="00:54.087">head's </span><span begin="00:54.087" end="00:54.339">in </span><span begin="00:54.339" end="00:54.615">the </span><span begin="00:54.615" end="00:55.791">clouds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.495" end="01:01.013"><span begin="00:55.495" end="00:58.435">Well </span><span begin="00:58.435" end="00:58.727">go </span><span begin="00:58.727" end="00:58.991">get </span><span begin="00:58.991" end="00:59.271">your </span><span begin="00:59.271" end="01:01.006">shovel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.713" end="01:04.275"><span begin="01:00.713" end="01:01.276">And </span><span begin="01:01.276" end="01:01.527">we'll </span><span begin="01:01.527" end="01:01.856">dig </span><span begin="01:01.856" end="01:02.183">a </span><span begin="01:02.183" end="01:02.449">deep </span><span begin="01:02.449" end="01:04.275">hole</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.975" end="01:10.167"><span begin="01:03.975" end="01:04.550">To </span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:04.843">bury </span><span begin="01:04.843" end="01:05.150">the </span><span begin="01:05.150" end="01:07.071">castle  </span><span begin="01:07.071" end="01:07.439">bury </span><span begin="01:07.439" end="01:07.775">the </span><span begin="01:07.775" end="01:10.162">castle</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.867" end="01:12.799"><span begin="01:09.867" end="01:10.450">Go </span><span begin="01:10.450" end="01:10.739">get </span><span begin="01:10.739" end="01:11.026">your </span><span begin="01:11.026" end="01:12.790">shovel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.499" end="01:15.678"><span begin="01:12.499" end="01:13.562">And </span><span begin="01:13.562" end