egin="01:39.806" end="01:40.442">prince </span><span begin="01:40.442" end="01:40.710">finally </span><span begin="01:40.710" end="01:40.962">came </span><span begin="01:40.962" end="01:41.225">to </span><span begin="01:41.225" end="01:41.478">save </span><span begin="01:41.478" end="01:42.345">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.054" end="01:44.914"><span begin="01:42.054" end="01:42.622">And </span><span begin="01:42.622" end="01:42.858">the </span><span begin="01:42.858" end="01:43.125">rest </span><span begin="01:43.125" end="01:43.366">you </span><span begin="01:43.366" end="01:43.606">can </span><span begin="01:43.606" end="01:43.846">figure </span><span begin="01:43.846" end="01:44.913">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.614" end="01:47.531"><span begin="01:44.614" end="01:45.190">But </span><span begin="01:45.190" end="01:45.469">it </span><span begin="01:45.469" end="01:45.738">was </span><span begin="01:45.738" end="01:45.995">a </span><span begin="01:45.995" end="01:47.530">trick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.231" end="01:50.673"><span begin="01:47.231" end="01:47.778">And </span><span begin="01:47.778" end="01:48.058">the </span><span begin="01:48.058" end="01:48.322">clock </span><span begin="01:48.322" end="01:48.598">struck </span><span begin="01:48.598" end="01:50.673">12</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.373" end="01:54.162"><span begin="01:50.373" end="01:50.902">Well </span><span begin="01:50.902" end="01:51.162">make </span><span begin="01:51.162" end="01:51.442">sure </span><span begin="01:51.442" end="01:51.710">to </span><span begin="01:51.710" end="01:51.966">build </span><span begin="01:51.966" end="01:52.214">your </span><span begin="01:52.214" end="01:52.462">house </span><span begin="01:52.462" end="01:52.710">brick </span><span begin="01:52.710" end="01:52.958">by </span><span begin="01:52.958" end="01:53.222">boring </span><span begin="01:53.222" end="01:54.153">brick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begi